#: ../../entities/roche.rst:1
msgid "Roche Accelerator"
msgstr "罗氏加速器"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:4
msgid "罗氏加速器"
msgstr "罗氏加速器"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:6
msgid "Corporate program | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "企业创新计划｜浦东新区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Health, AI for Science."
msgstr "人工智能与产业方向：健康、科学智能。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:10
msgid ""
"Roche describes its Shanghai innovation accelerator for the China "
"ecosystem. Relevant to healthcare and AI-enabled discovery teams. "
"Scientific fit, space, collaboration, funding and IP terms are distinct "
"questions."
msgstr "罗氏介绍其位于上海、服务中国创新生态的加速器，适合医疗健康及人工智能研发团队。科研匹配、空间、合作、资金与知识产权须分别确认。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S034 "
"<https://www.roche.com/innovation/structure/cicor/roche-accelerator>`_. "
"Roche | Roche accelerator."
msgstr "`证据 S034 <https://www.roche.com/innovation/structure/cicor/roche-accelerator>`_. Roche | Roche accelerator."

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official website / intake route "
"<https://www.roche.com/innovation/structure/cicor/roche-accelerator>`_"
msgstr "`官网／对接入口 <https://www.roche.com/innovation/structure/cicor/roche-accelerator>`_"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:26
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网联系负责团队，确认现行申请渠道。本刊不刊载邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:28
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:30
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:33
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:35
msgid "Identify the corporate business owner and one measurable use case."
msgstr "确认企业业务负责人及可量化场景。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit the product brief, pilot evidence and relevant technical "
"requirements."
msgstr "提交产品简介、试点证据及相关技术要求。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:39
msgid ""
"Confirm cohort availability or agree a scoped pilot, data rights and IP "
"terms."
msgstr "确认招募情况或约定试点范围、数据权利与知识产权。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:41
msgid ""
"Review procurement, payment, acceptance and the production decision "
"separately."
msgstr "分别审核采购、付款、验收及转生产决策。"

#: ../../entities/roche.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`Pudong district route </districts/pudong>`"
msgstr ":doc:`浦东新区对接路径 </districts/pudong>`"

